<title>USA: West Fargo PSD 6, N.D., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>West Fargo PSD 6, N.D., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $6.320 million of West Fargo PSD 6, N.D., general obligation school building refunding bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.6634 percent.</p>
</text>
